From: SovereignOS Build <build@sovereignos.local>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 11:39:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sovereignos: add the duress decoy user type, routing and
 keyguard hook

Squash of former patches:

- 0001 sovereignos: add USER_TYPE_FULL_SOVEREIGNOS_DECOY user type
- 0002 sovereignos: accept USER_TYPE_FULL_SOVEREIGNOS_DECOY into system-current.txt
- 0003 sovereignos: add dialog-free silent user switch for duress decoy
- 0004 sovereignos: add decoy profile routing state storage
- 0005 sovereignos: add DecoyProfileHelper keyguard hook and freeze/switch orchestration
- 0006 sovereignos: wire decoy routing into doVerifyCredentialInner
- 0007 sovereignos: add set-decoy-profile/clear-decoy-profile shell commands
